me":{"zh":"英雄集结","en":"A Gathering of Heroes"},"year":"300","month":"3"},"faction":"WJ10163","city":"CS1070","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"2","role":0,"stats":[63,45,73,71,77,68],"title":-1,"rank":"9","loyalty":"100","reputation":"0","equipment":{"weapon":"WP1007102","armor":"WP1030605","helmet":"WP1013302"},"couple":[]}],"storyEvents":[{"kind":"plot","id":"1000124","name":{"zh":"覆巢完卵","en":"No Intact Eggs in an Overturned Nest"},"year":"208","month":"1","desc":{"zh":"孔融因屡次触怒曹操，被路粹、郗虑罗织死罪。                                                                                                                               亲历条件：【与孔融关系等级≥2】、【孔融为曹操势力武将】\n\n禁忌条件：主角为曹操，孔融，孔舒，王修，许褚，程昱时无法触发。\n\n逆天改命： 【救下孔融、孔舒，使其避免死亡】；【<玩家不属曹操势力>使其成为家将】","en":"Kong Rong, having repeatedly infuriated Cao Cao, was framed for capital crimes by Lu Cui and Xi Lu.                                                                                                                               Participation Condition: 【Relationship level with Kong Rong ≥ 2】, 【Kong Rong is an Officer of Cao Cao's Faction】\n\n\n\nRestricted Condition: Cannot trigger if the protagonist is Cao Cao, Kong Rong, Kong Shu, Wang Xiu, Xu Chu, or Cheng Yu.\n\n\n\nDefy Fate: 【Save Kong Rong and Kong Shu to prevent their deaths】, 【<Player does not belong to Cao Cao's Faction> Recruit them as Retainers】"}}],"biography":{"zh":"东海太守孔融长女。孔氏十分聪慧，受家庭氛围影响，自幼开始研读典籍，与中原众多名士皆有往来。建安十三年，孔融因言论触怒曹操，被以大逆罪名诛族。孔舒在父亲旧部的帮助下得以逃脱，成为覆巢完卵。后嫁与羊祜之父羊衜，生羊发。","tc":"東海太守孔融長女。孔氏十分聰慧，受家庭氛圍影響，自幼開始研讀典籍，與中原眾多名士皆有往來。建安十三年，孔融因言論觸怒曹操，被以大逆罪名誅族。孔舒在父親舊部的幫助下得以逃脫，成為覆巢完卵。后嫁與羊祜之父羊衜，生羊發。","en":"Eldest daughter of Kong Rong, the Governor of Donghai. Lady Kong was exceptionally intelligent. Immersed in her family's scholarly atmosphere from an early age, she studied the classics and maintained ties with many renowned scholars of Zhongyuan. In the thirteenth year of Jianan, Kong Rong provoked Cao Cao with his outspoken criticism and was executed along with his clan on charges of high treason. With the assistance of her father's former subordinates, Kong Shu managed to escape, miraculously surviving the destruction of her family. She later married Yang Dao, the father of Yang Hu, and gave birth to Yang Fa.","jp":"東海太守・孔融の長女。孔氏は極めて聡明で、家庭環境の影響を受けて幼少より典籍を研鑽し、中原の多くの名士と広く交流を持っていた。建安十三年、孔融がその言論によって曹操の怒りを買い、「大逆」の罪名で誅族されると、孔舒は父の旧部の助けを得て逃げ延び、「覆巣の完卵」と称された。後に羊祜の父である羊衜に嫁ぎ、羊発を産んだ。","kr":"동해태수 공융의 장녀. 공씨는 매우 총명하여 가풍의 영향을 받아 어려서부터 전적을 탐독하였고, 중원의 여러 명사들과 교류하였다. 건안 13년, 공융이 언사로 조조의 노여움을 사 대역죄로 멸족당했을 때, 공서는 부친 옛 부하들의 도움으로 탈출하여 뒤엎어진 둥지에서 온전히 살아남은 알이 되었다. 훗날 양호의 부친 양도에게 시집가 양발을 낳았다."},"notRecommended":{"type":"0","year":"999","reason":{"zh":"","tc":"","en":"","jp":"","kr":""}},"raw":{"userIndex":"15","id":"WJ1015102","remark":"","surname":"孔","surnameTc":"孔","surnameEn":"Kong","surnameJp":"孔","surnameKr":"공","surnameOther":"","name":"舒","nameTc":"舒","nameEn":"Shu","nameJp":"舒","nameKr":"서","nameOther":"","word":"","wordTc":"","wordEn":"","wordJp":"","wordKr":"","wordOther":"","icon":"孔舒","power":"WJ10163","rejectPower":"","rejectDuration":"0","ignoreUnRecruit":"0","ignoreUnSelectable":"0","unSelectable":"0","recruit":"1","travel":"0","state":"2","workYear":"190","city":"CS1017","gender":"1","rule":"63","force":"45","wise":"73","politics":"71","charm":"77","will":"68","ruleTalent":"6","forceTalent":"4","wiseTalent":"8","politicsTalent":"8","charmTalent":"9","willTalent":"7","weaponMaster":"15/15/15/15/15/76/75/15","battleAttribute":"1/1/1/1/1/1/1/1","debateAttribute":"1/1/1","warSkill":"","battleSkill":"","debateCard":"","warSoul":"S1001205","battleSoul":"","debateSoul":"1007905","warSoulPoint":"4000","battleSoulPoint":"2000","debateSoulPoint":"5300","strategy":"1004308","strategy2":"1001605","professions":"1/0/0/1/0/0/1/0/2/2/1/2/0/1/0/3/0/1/2/0/1/0/1/1","attribute2":"68/45/78/71/77/80","morality":"5","compatible":"25","loyalty":"100","reputation":"0","evaluate":"3000","title":"","rank":"9","birth":"176","show":"190","death":"234","age":"0","injury":"","deat